OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way after a
OL,7,F22-year-old woman was killed and five
OL,8,Fothers injured in a shooting at a rave
OL,9,Fin Switzerland.
OL,11,FThe woman died at the scene in Aarau,
OL,12,Fpolice said. Four men and a woman, aged
OL,13,Fbetween 24 and 27, are in hospital with
OL,14,Finjuries "ranging from minor to
OL,15,Fsevere".
OL,17,FSources have confirmed to BBC News that
OL,18,Fthe victim was an Italian national. The
OL,19,FItalian Embassy in Bern and the
OL,20,FConsulate in Zurich are monitoring the
OL,21,Fsituation, they add.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
